{"sessionId":"L1-S18","number":18,"sessionTitle":"Make It Yours: A Helper for My Home","title":"Nana’s Foggy Night","titleCard":{"text":"Episode 18. Nana’s Foggy Night.","file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S18/title.ogg","dur":3.156,"env":"0006u60trprqyzzzsde0ttsg03niyvvtttsqh00000000002xzzzzxzxvtglf203tzuk46vxuwxxutspqpl803d60000000","words":[["Episode",0.1,0.9],["18.",0.9,1.23],["Nana’s",1.59,2.03],["Foggy",2.03,2.48],["Night.",2.48,2.92]],"voice":"narrator"},"previously":{"text":"The robot lit up the dark tunnel. Fog covered the hill, and they sheltered at Nana’s house…","file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S18/prev.ogg","dur":6.036,"env":"000pyzurqonellb0be00idtutssusrsqpoe00000000000qqwzzyu6fxpd5kym2jowp8083sh2rzzxvqa0b4fegxwxvussk200000000004yxqm75400cbtoete0602vwjquppopqotnksrzzxvi0bk7hi24zzyuurvsvssqmdie200000000","words":[["Last",0.1,0.63],["time...",0.63,1.16],["The",1.52,1.72],["robot",1.72,2.02],["lit",2.02,2.22],["up",2.22,2.38],["the",2.38,2.58],["dark",2.58,2.83],["tunnel.",2.83,3.17],["Fog",3.53,3.7],["covered",3.7,4.01],["the",4.01,4.18],["hill,",4.18,4.38],["and",4.38,4.54],["they",4.54,4.74],["sheltered",4.74,5.13],["at",5.13,5.26],["Nana’s",5.26,5.5],["house…",5.5,5.74]],"voice":"narrator"},"scenes":[{"setting":"Nana Lucía’s cosy house: a kitchen, a living room with an armchair, a hallway. Fog presses at the windows.","action":"Nana sits down slowly; her knees are tired after the long day. Amara brings her tea, but her hands are full.","seconds":40,"lines":[{"i":0,"who":"lucia","guestName":null,"text":"Oof. My knees have walked a long way today.","direction":null,"file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S18/0.ogg","dur":3.628,"env":"003vzzzzzwd75589600000000000000nrqsqsssutvtnwvcpi7dousn9028tctpnnorssqssrpqrposoooobonal5eronomnkljjif6000000","words":[["Oof.",0.11,0.54],["My",1.04,1.24],["knees",1.24,1.61],["have",1.61,1.92],["walked",1.92,2.34],["a",2.34,2.48],["long",2.48,2.79],["way",2.79,3.05],["today.",3.05,3.41]],"voice":"lucia"},{"i":1,"who":"amara","guestName":null,"text":"A robot could help at home! Carry things. Light the hallway at night.","direction":null,"file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S18/1.ogg","dur":5.91,"env":"000000000000000000000000kxwzzzznuzzc0bizntluzzteeupcozzzzzwywvr70000000000000000000009cnqttusrrq726srqqsqptmhclij700000000000000000avxrsa00nqg8bsqrpqrqnjkg6hligige930840000000000","words":[["A",0.1,0.27],["robot",0.27,0.71],["could",0.71,1.16],["help",1.16,1.54],["at",1.54,1.78],["home!",1.78,2.15],["Carry",2.67,3.23],["things.",3.23,3.87],["Light",4.31,4.6],["the",4.6,4.8],["hallway",4.8,5.18],["at",5.18,5.34],["night.",5.34,5.63]],"voice":"amara"},{"i":2,"who":"lucia","guestName":null,"text":"The best robots help people where they live — kindly and safely.","direction":null,"file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S18/2.ogg","dur":4.286,"env":"008udcizzwleuvt6a98lwzwv9grl72rj68ousrc007d4rr30dusmhvvup5nuustrrwsspnf8563000afgcjsrpssrrr96gsusrqproqsurdtqsk56653qmljfc5000000","words":[["The",0.1,0.36],["best",0.36,0.68],["robots",0.68,1.11],["help",1.11,1.42],["people",1.42,1.86],["where",1.86,2.23],["they",2.23,2.55],["live",2.55,2.86],["—",2.86,2.95],["kindly",2.95,3.38],["and",3.38,3.64],["safely.",3.64,4.07]],"voice":"lucia"}]},{"setting":"The toolbox on the kitchen table: pen, scoop, headlight.","action":"Spark holds up each tool and imagines a home job for it: a scoop carrying a tea biscuit, a light guiding the way to bed, a pen drawing a \"welcome home\" path.","seconds":35,"lines":[{"i":3,"who":"spark","guestName":null,"text":"Which job will your robot do? Which tool will you choose?","direction":null,"file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S18/3.ogg","dur":3.694,"env":"00ps9amg3euzutra7bqsoipwxsfcoyyxn8wr6420eqolnoi700000000rzt4dvpgljeztzzzywzxhrzzvgouv8ctqjzzwzzzxokeqpf30000000","words":[["Which",0.08,0.39],["job",0.39,0.6],["will",0.6,0.86],["your",0.86,1.12],["robot",1.12,1.43],["do?",1.43,1.6],["Which",1.89,2.24],["tool",2.24,2.53],["will",2.53,2.82],["you",2.82,3.06],["choose?",3.06,3.46]],"voice":"spark"},{"i":4,"who":"lucia","guestName":null,"text":"Ask first: what does the person need? Then choose the tool.","direction":null,"file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S18/4.ogg","dur":4.261,"env":"00brsjyp57bb89euwtspgssr2g7bvtn0hqtqm59p0567qvshsqklpqrsttrooomh678000000000000007zwzzzwbqtspmzzzzqkmb0ro0rigbxyxzuusssrob000000","words":[["Ask",0.1,0.34],["first:",0.34,0.69],["what",0.69,0.99],["does",0.99,1.28],["the",1.28,1.53],["person",1.53,1.93],["need?",1.93,2.22],["Then",2.72,3.04],["choose",3.04,3.47],["the",3.47,3.73],["tool.",3.73,4.05]],"voice":"lucia"}]},{"setting":"Nana’s living room after the children’s helpers have run (plays after sharing).","action":"One helper rolls under the sofa to fetch Nana’s slipper — and pushes out a glowing ball: the ninth light! Counter: 9 of 12. Outside, the fog is even thicker.","seconds":45,"lines":[{"i":5,"who":"spark","guestName":null,"text":"Nine! It rolled in under the door during the storm!","direction":null,"file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S18/5.ogg","dur":3.191,"env":"02rponoppolle300000000yy576szywzr7zucfimjgatubqk520rzzzvtut9b7hqvqpqijikgnsn4orquytmlgllk4000000","words":[["Nine!",0.08,0.45],["It",0.75,0.9],["rolled",0.9,1.24],["in",1.24,1.4],["under",1.4,1.69],["the",1.69,1.9],["door",1.9,2.15],["during",2.15,2.48],["the",2.48,2.69],["storm!",2.69,2.98]],"voice":"spark"},{"i":6,"who":"amara","guestName":null,"text":"Three more. But the fog is so thick, even the headlight can’t help — the light just bounces off the fog.","direction":null,"file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S18/6.ogg","dur":6.29,"env":"00000000078szzzzzzzxxvvtsmjb0000000000000000000000nnj4ji44pzzzyqa8lommpmvvtm03gsuqpe0b30nwuksszxrfpttjrsqa0dcrvsrodssrla33200004ttqsxytpcclsmkg00uqonrfjjpnheoqre30ekb3dmpjgd0053200000000000","words":[["Three",0.09,0.7],["more.",0.7,1.22],["But",1.47,1.68],["the",1.68,1.89],["fog",1.89,2.1],["is",2.1,2.27],["so",2.27,2.43],["thick,",2.43,2.74],["even",2.74,3.0],["the",3.0,3.21],["headlight",3.21,3.7],["can’t",3.7,3.96],["help",3.96,4.22],["—",4.22,4.29],["the",4.29,4.5],["light",4.5,4.8],["